{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X 的大块本身交代了人物当下的处境、原因和转折，单扫大字也能串起来；Y 的高亮词单独看更像零散的情绪标签。core：两版都围绕亲密的幸福与留不住它的痛楚展开，完整的情感变化也都能看出来，差距不明显。small、fine：X 的小字更多落在鼻酸、心漂远、喉咙发紧等具体的人物体验上，补充性较好；Y 的感受经常夹入较长的旋律描写，人的体验和音乐描述来回切换。concise：X 的主线更短、更直接，Y 有较多解释性铺陈和意思相近的反复。human：Y 有“像一句想了很久的话，到了嘴边先沉默几秒”“放到开阔的尺度”“前面悬置的期待”“身体恢复弹性”等搭配或语气不够自然的问题；X 也有“相识已久地安静坐着”等小问题，但整体更接近日常表达。load：Y 的高亮短语虽然有几处，但长度短，扫读负担较轻；X 后段尤其 S13、S14 的五六个大块在34至39秒内累积较多。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b5c3a02d-7ac4-4098-ba90-57e770b72f94", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T035806005874Z", "elapsed_seconds": 367.313, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T04:04:13.333649+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ab35bc75512dd018d639b0e21ae9e206a72b1eb8c979db7c8109af4903794246", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d